# $SKILLS_HOME/.env
#
# Shared env file for all skills. Copy this to $SKILLS_HOME/.env and fill in
# values for the nodes in your topology. This file is gitignored — it is
# machine-local and may contain secrets.
#
# Convention: skills that depend on topology-skill store their per-node
# secrets here, keyed as <NODE>_<SERVICE>_<VAR>. The topology.md table records
# the env var name (e.g. hermes_key_env: POND_HERMES_KEY) so the skill knows
# where to look.

# --- ask-agent-skill (Hermes gateway, peer mode) ---

# POND_HERMES_KEY=<bearer token set in ~/.hermes/.env on pond as API_SERVER_KEY>
# GOLLUM_HERMES_KEY=<bearer token set in ~/.hermes/.env on gollum as API_SERVER_KEY>
